  gestures: "[happy][wave] Hi! [think] Let me show you what I can do. [shrug] I can shrug, [clap][happy] clap, [point] point at things, [scratch] scratch my head, [cheer][happy:1] cheer, [dance] and even dance! [facepalm][sad:0.4] Okay, that was a lot. [sigh] Phew. [bow][relaxed] Thanks for watching.",
  long: "[relaxed] So here's how this works. [nod] A language model writes a reply with little emotion tags mixed in. [happy] The page strips them out, speaks the words, and changes my face right when each tag comes up. [sad:0.6] If the news is bad, I can look a bit down. [angry:0.5] If something is annoying, I can frown. [surprised] And if something is amazing, well, [bounce][happy] you get the idea!",
